### Logs ###
logs/*
# The dev compose mounts logs/autotrader-dev; tracking a placeholder keeps that directory
# (and therefore logs/) from being created root-owned by Docker on a fresh clone.
!logs/autotrader-dev/
logs/autotrader-dev/*
!logs/autotrader-dev/.gitkeep

### VS Code ###
.vscode/
